{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：17:15 2026-11-03 HKT</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/68fdf2819b3cac3d4d0a672dd4e6c7bf/2026-11/KF_-_2026-11-03T170958_295_0.jpg\"/>\n<p>當積(Luka Doncic)延續火熱火感！湖人休整僅約24小時，周一背靠背撼熱火，這名斯洛伐克射手表現繼續神勇，轟入42分外加13分下，率領「紫金軍團」以138:117大勝熱火。</p>\n<img alt=\"今季加盟湖人的中鋒基斯勒(Walker Kessler)的15分15籃板統治禁區。AFP\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da0d245e4d16712a7c6dba7d25fad123/2026-11/AFP__20261103__2302841617__v1__HighRes__MiamiHeatVLosAngelesLakers.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"湖人138:117輕取熱火。AFP\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a44f68b6a3dd49035f74d8caa77f9f00/2026-11/AFP__20261103__2302829873__v1__HighRes__MiamiHeatVLosAngelesLakers.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"艾迪巴約(Bam Adebayo)則攻下16分9籃板。AFP\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b77cd62e41f5a1a0f10af2fa66cda426/2026-11/AFP__20261103__2303248520__v1__HighRes__MiamiHeatVLosAngelesLakers.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"當積(Luka Doncic)轟42分外加13助攻和7籃板。AFP\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e22d2070b06b044856f772e73c60f27d/2026-11/AFP__20261103__2302830079__v1__HighRes__MiamiHeatVLosAngelesLakers.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「字母哥」安迪杜古普(Giannis Antetokounmpo)今仗空砍30分12籃板7助攻。AFP\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ec854904671781c2b9c89553dbd21462/2026-11/AFP__20261103__2303248417__v1__HighRes__MiamiHeatVLosAngelesLakers.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"當積最近狀態大好，近五場賽事得分37+。AFP\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a326f040ed6816663db7121129eaf64d/2026-11/AFP__20261103__2303248487__v1__HighRes__MiamiHeatVLosAngelesLakers.jpg\"/>\n<p>作為上季得分王的當積最近狀態大好，近五場賽事得分37+，包括前一天擊敗速龍時，亦攻入45分和抓下15籃板。然而迎來背靠背對上熱火他亦未有表現出任何疲態，反而手感仍相當火熱，首節便獨得16分5助攻4籃板，助球隊早段便建立起優勢。</p>\n<p>今戰攻入27分的里夫斯(Austin Reaves)亦承擔不少進攻火力，他在當積稍作休息時亦成功撐住場面助力湖人逐步擴大分差，再加上今季加盟的中鋒基斯勒(Walker Kessler)的15分15籃板統治禁區下，最終在當積灌注42分外加13助攻和7籃板下，以138:117擊敗熱火。</p>\n<p>「字母哥」安迪杜古普(Giannis Antetokounmpo)今仗空砍30分12籃板7助攻，而艾迪巴約(Bam Adebayo)則攻下16分9籃板，奇利湯遜(Klay Thompson)亦獻出19分，然而目前的戰績對今夏大手引援的熱火而言亦並不合格，今場過後熱火七戰僅得兩勝，目前排在東岸排第十。<br/> </p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T09:24:18.995164+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":523,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T09:15:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T15:58:54.974785+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T09:20:03.871474+00:00","content_hash":"92ae93a4c08403e29ad4bc960bfef0fbe7b9052c1422b837d257801d10096565","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}